<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN JUNE UNEMPLOYMENT 5.3 PCT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN JUNE UNEMPLOYMENT 5.3 PCT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment declined to 5.3 percent in June from 5.6 percent in May, the Labour Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>  LITHUANIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     June '97   May '97   June '96</p>
<p>  Unemployment rate (percent)  5.3	 5.6	 7.0</p>
<p>  Number of unemployed	  93,293     98,980    122,004</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
